{"seq":8,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:27:55.317Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"5941f17b33befbbc18301af20e90abf1af545d801319ba15bc332856fe18ad96","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Gideon Sato: you first reported the kiosks offline at 10:42 AM on 3 Aug (company time, UTC-5). That was your message in this channel: both inbound lanes showing a white screen after badge scan.\n\nWhat the guard was doing: in that same 10:42 message you said the guard was writing trailer numbers on a clipboard. Later messages here give no other detail on the guard until 11:03 AM. Mateo then said kiosk 1 was back and the guard checked in trailer 8836, which dispatch could see. At 11:08 AM you posted that both lanes were working as of 11:07.\n\nSo the guard was on the clipboard from at least 10:42 until kiosk 1 came back around 11:03. The channel doesn't say exactly when the guard started the clipboard, or when they stopped.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":9,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:27:58.359Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"faf32b226b9ab883aab40f09739fa323650e51eecace6a59055fe86c18858783","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"I replied to Gideon in the thread on #inc-vtg-hartford. Here is the answer.\n\n- **First report:** Gideon first reported the kiosks offline at 10:42 AM on 3 Aug (UTC-5). He said both inbound lanes showed a white screen after badge scan.\n- **The guard:** In that same 10:42 message he said the guard was writing trailer numbers on a clipboard. Nothing else in the channel describes the guard until 11:03 AM, when Mateo said kiosk 1 was back and the guard checked in trailer 8836. Gideon posted at 11:08 AM that both lanes were working as of 11:07.\n- **Gap:** The channel doesn't say exactly when the guard started or stopped using the clipboard. I told Gideon that too."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
